        {
          "text": "nkaambo uyoominta akuzyala mwana mulombe, elyo oyo mulombe takooyoonyoolwa abuniini pe, nkaambo uyooba mu-Naziri wa-Leza mazuba oonse kuzwa kubuzyale bwakwe. Ngonguwe uuti vune ba-Israyeli kumaanza aaba-Filisti, ",
