        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwanakazi wakasika kumulumaakwe nkwaakabede, wakamwaambila kuti, Kwandizida muntu wa-Leza. Busyu bwakwe bwakali mbuli busyu bwaangelo waLeza, bwakayoosya loko. Pele teendakamubuzya nkwaakazwa pe, alimwi takwakandaambila izina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela wakandaambila kuti, Bona! Uyoominta akuzyala mwana mulombe. Lino utanywi waini niciba cintu cimwi cikola, alimwi utalyi cintu niciba cimwi cisofweede, nkaambo mulombe uyooba mu-Naziri wa-Leza kuzwa kubuzyale bwakwe kusikila kubuzuba bwalufu lwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
